| --------------- | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |
| Evidence        | Source must be identifiable.               | Provenance validation       |
| Transparency    | Decisions must be auditable.               | Audit completeness          |
| Accountability  | Actions must have attributable identities. | Digital signatures          |
| Preservation    | Records must remain recoverable.           | Replication checks          |
| Security        | Permissions must be enforced.              | Authorization tests         |
| Adaptability    | New evidence can trigger reassessment.     | Versioned policy evaluation |

